{"2167530": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "V's Rage", "steam_appid": 2167530, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>“RISE FROM YOUR BED...”</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That’s how V’s nightmare begins: a stressed-out mom and wife, woken by a mysterious voice and dragged into a cursed videogame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now she must beat any foe unlucky enough to cross her path and escape a crazy low-poly world inhabited by strange creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s only one way out: hit everything. With a frying pan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/50e23d7e75ddc5180026e161082a8fa1.poster.avif?t=1756836007\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/50e23d7e75ddc5180026e161082a8fa1.webm?t=1756836007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/50e23d7e75ddc5180026e161082a8fa1.mp4?t=1756836007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANY GENRES. ZERO MERCY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V’s Rage is a hand-drawn arcade adventure inspired by the great arcade classics of the ’80s and ’90s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect frantic combat, absurd enemies, and gameplay rules that change with every stage. Each level throws you into a new experience: Beat ’em up, Shoot ’em up, Run and Gun, Side-scroller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn, fail, swear, repeat. No tutorials, no guidance. Just pure, classic arcade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/1e9804e88acfedbceb02bef3d126aac4.poster.avif?t=1756836007\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/1e9804e88acfedbceb02bef3d126aac4.webm?t=1756836007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/1e9804e88acfedbceb02bef3d126aac4.mp4?t=1756836007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BETWEEN ARCADE CABINETS AND ’80s ANIME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V’s Rage is rooted in the spirit of old-school coin-ops like Final Fight, Altered Beast, and Parodius.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its visual style is a hand-drawn explosion of ’80s anime energy, a nostalgic tribute to iconic characters like <i>Lum</i> and <i>Ranma</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/dfa7de125fcca5a4ad829b1f8de056ca.poster.avif?t=1756836007\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/dfa7de125fcca5a4ad829b1f8de056ca.webm?t=1756836007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/dfa7de125fcca5a4ad829b1f8de056ca.mp4?t=1756836007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>“RISE FROM YOUR BED...”</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That’s how V’s nightmare begins: a stressed-out mom and wife, woken by a mysterious voice and dragged into a cursed videogame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now she must beat any foe unlucky enough to cross her path and escape a crazy low-poly world inhabited by strange creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There’s only one way out: hit everything. With a frying pan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/50e23d7e75ddc5180026e161082a8fa1.poster.avif?t=1756836007\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/50e23d7e75ddc5180026e161082a8fa1.webm?t=1756836007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/50e23d7e75ddc5180026e161082a8fa1.mp4?t=1756836007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANY GENRES. ZERO MERCY.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V’s Rage is a hand-drawn arcade adventure inspired by the great arcade classics of the ’80s and ’90s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect frantic combat, absurd enemies, and gameplay rules that change with every stage. Each level throws you into a new experience: Beat ’em up, Shoot ’em up, Run and Gun, Side-scroller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn, fail, swear, repeat. No tutorials, no guidance. Just pure, classic arcade</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/1e9804e88acfedbceb02bef3d126aac4.poster.avif?t=1756836007\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/1e9804e88acfedbceb02bef3d126aac4.webm?t=1756836007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/1e9804e88acfedbceb02bef3d126aac4.mp4?t=1756836007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BETWEEN ARCADE CABINETS AND ’80s ANIME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V’s Rage is rooted in the spirit of old-school coin-ops like Final Fight, Altered Beast, and Parodius.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Its visual style is a hand-drawn explosion of ’80s anime energy, a nostalgic tribute to iconic characters like <i>Lum</i> and <i>Ranma</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/dfa7de125fcca5a4ad829b1f8de056ca.poster.avif?t=1756836007\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/dfa7de125fcca5a4ad829b1f8de056ca.webm?t=1756836007\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/extras/dfa7de125fcca5a4ad829b1f8de056ca.mp4?t=1756836007\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "You’re a raging mom trapped in an arcade nightmare. Hit, parry, shoot, survive, while each level twists the genre. No hand-holding in this hand-drawn comic-style mayhem. Just rage. And a frying pan.", "supported_languages": "English, Italian, Simplified Chinese, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Portugal", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/e5e02d10aa56e3b2f737d485a088839ae37e17d5/header.jpg?t=1756836007", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/4d4189d430c4bb511494045941eb35062411f98a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756836007", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2167530/4d4189d430c4bb511494045941eb35062411f98a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756836007", "website": "https://www.bitmaniax.com/newbix/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><stron